      "synopsis_en": "ZOO is a film about the zoo in Miami, Florida, the care and maintenance of the animals by the keepers, the work of the veterinarians and their staff, and the visits to the zoo by people from all over the world. The film presents the wide diversity of interests and activities at the zoo and the interrelatedness of the animal, human, ethical, financial, technical, organizational and research aspects of operating the zoo.",
      "synopsis_zh": "纪录片宗师怀斯曼这次把目光聚焦于动物，将镜头潜入佛罗里达迈阿密的动物园，真实记录这座拥有 780 只动物、数百个物种的园区日常，展现饲养员的照料、兽医的诊疗，以及世界各地游客的来访，串联起动物、人类与动物园运营的多重关联。",
