      "synopsis_en": "After her parents’ passing, eight-year-old Violet goes to live with her uncle, Regis, a gruff maintenance worker at the Palace of Versailles. Despite a rocky start, Violet and Regis learn to live and face life’s challenges together. Through complex friendships, first loves and a Christmas trip to Violet’s grandparents, they slowly create a new life rich in discoveries and tender moments in the heart of Versailles.",
      "synopsis_zh": "父母双亡后，八岁的薇奥莉被送往凡尔赛宫与维修工叔叔雷吉斯同住。面对陌生的环境和内心的伤痛，性格迥异的两人从相互抵触到彼此扶持，在凡尔赛宫这座恢弘宫殿的见证下，共同直面生活的挑战。一段关于治愈与成长的全新生活，就此展开。本片改编自同名获第29届安锡国际动画节电视特别节目评审奖动画短片，入围第51届法国凯撒奖最佳动画片单元。",
