      "country": "Argentina, Belgium, Spain, France",
      "country_zh": null,
      "runtime": 70,
      "language": "CA",
      "synopsis_en": "Olivia, a 12-year-old middle class girl, is forced to reorganize her basic needs when her family (mother, little brother and herself) is evicted and forced to live in a squatted apartment on the edge of the big city, in a rough neighborhood. Her mother can no longer bear the situation and falls in a depression, so Olivia has to replace her. It means caring for her brother and her own mother, while dealing with the feeling of an emotional earthquake. But she is not alone, Olivia will make friends that will help her to see her own life from other points of view. Because things don’t always happen the way we want, but we can choose the way we live them.",
      "synopsis_zh": "影片改编自麦特·卡兰萨的小说《生活的电影》，为加泰罗尼亚首部定格动画长片。12岁女孩奥利维亚在全家突遭驱逐后，为保护7岁弟弟，将流离失所的困境描绘成一场电影拍摄的奇想游戏。然而受打击的母亲逐渐沉默抑郁，奥利维亚不得不独自支撑。本片以黏土与羊毛等材质复刻巴塞罗那街巷，在安纳西国际动画电影节获评甘基金会发行奖，并入围第38届欧洲电影奖最佳动画与最佳影片。",
