      "runtime": 110,
      "language": "IT",
      "synopsis_en": "On March 21, 1956, Anna Magnani wins the Academy Award for Best Actress. She spends the night waiting for the news wandering the streets of Rome. However, an unpredictable turn of fate pushes her aside at the moment of her greatest splendor, showing her human side and the world that surrounds her. Above everything is Roberto Rossellini, \"an imprint in the heart that lives on even when time has erased everything else.\"",
      "synopsis_zh": "1956年3月21日，安娜·玛尼亚尼凭借《玫瑰梦》荣获奥斯卡最佳女主角。在那个等待消息揭晓的夜晚，她游荡在罗马的街巷与广场，穿行徘徊在爱她的人群以及挥之不去的往事里。当时守在她身边的，是后来成为她经纪人的年轻女子卡罗尔·莱维。黎明终于带回了胜利的喜讯，然而这份荣光却转瞬即逝——命运那难以捉摸的拐点，竟在她艺术生命的巅峰时刻降临。",
