      "country_zh": null,
      "runtime": 106,
      "language": "AR",
      "synopsis_en": "Haroun is an old bachelor who has lived in Oran for several years. A retired civil servant, he leads a reclusive life until the day he meets Kamel in a bar—a journalist to whom he tells an incredible story dating back to 1942. He claims to be the brother of ‘the Arab’ killed in a story told in one of the most famous novels of the 20th century, ‘The Stranger’ by Albert Camus. An Arab with an erased name: Moussa. Through anger, assertions, details, and confidences, Haroun finally convinces the journalist to listen to his story. His confession is a cry of freedom and distress—but above all, a cry of revolt: against an abusive mother, against a country that failed to achieve true independence, against a book, and against a famous French writer.",
      "synopsis_zh": "默尔索枯坐在死囚牢房里。他即将被执行死刑，罪名是谋杀了一个连他自己都不知道名字的男人。在加缪1942年的名作《局外人》中，这个名字成了永远的留白。然而，那个在整部书中被粗暴地统称为“阿拉伯人”的受害者，究竟是谁？2013年，阿尔及利亚作家卡梅尔·达乌德出版了翻案小说《默尔索：案情调查》，选择从另一面重新审视这桩影射历史的旧案。在这部作品里，死者终于有了名字：穆萨。凶案发生半个世纪后，在奥兰一家小酒馆里，穆萨的弟弟哈伦向一位记者吐露了家族的记忆。他描述了受害者视角的“那一天”，以及这场荒诞的谋杀如何摧毁了他和母亲的一生。",
