      "country": "South Africa",
      "country_zh": "俄罗斯",
      "runtime": 85,
      "language": "AF",
      "synopsis_en": "In a small fishing community on the outskirts of Cape Town, Gabriel discovers a dead body and two bags of valuable abalone. His brother, Michail, convinces him they must take it for themselves. But when a corrupt government worker pursues them, they embark on a journey into the mountains and are driven to the ends of the Cape of Good Hope for the survival of their relationship and their lives.",
      "synopsis_zh": "三位挚友扬帆入海，意欲寻回失落的感官。这场原本纯粹的旅程，逐渐蜕变为一场心灵求索，探寻何为英雄这一千古命题。\n他们追寻伊阿宋、大卫王、圣女贞德等先辈英雄的足迹，探寻处世真谛。但每一份解答，都衍生出新的疑惑。就在众人准备折返之时，一场意外邂逅颠覆过往，尘封谜题的真相终于揭晓。",
