      "order_in_program": 3,
      "color": "#c8902a",
      "director": "Ronny Gani",
      "director_zh": "罗尼·加尼",
      "country": "Indonesia, Singapore, Taiwan, South Korea",
      "country_zh": "印度尼西亚",
      "runtime": 78,
      "language": "ID",
      "synopsis_en": "Putra, a 13-year-old boy living with asthma, dreams of one day playing for Indonesia’s national football team. Often underestimated, his determination never wavers until he fails a crucial selection, making his dream feel impossibly out of reach.  Everything changes when he encounters Gaga, a mystical Garuda who offers him a new chance. Alongside Naya, a talented young footballer and the coach’s daughter who becomes his fiercest ally, Putra embarks on a journey filled with challenges, growth, and unexpected courage.  Through it all, Putra comes to understand that chasing a dream takes more than grit and bravery. It takes belief, and the people who stand beside you. The question is: can he rise above his limits and become one of Indonesia’s finest?",
      "synopsis_zh": "13岁的少年普特拉患有哮喘，却怀揣着为印尼国家队效力的梦想。他球技平平，但热爱从未消减。报名参加桑卡佩尔卡萨足球学校的选拔试训时，他遭到奥尔多嘲讽，被取笑体质孱弱、屡屡失误。普特拉备受打击，只好躲到墓园附近的球场与朋友们踢球，不料又遇上奥尔多前来挑衅。比赛中途，普特拉突然晕倒，醒来后竟来到另一个奇异幻境。在那里，他遇见了周身发光的迦楼罗精灵——Gaga。对方赠予他一件充满神秘力量的球衣，让他拥有了惊人的速度、力量与球技。他能否冲破质疑与嘲讽，成长为自己一直向往的足球运动员？",
      "poster_url": "https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9HD51PdRXC8prfTIu6qyp6hVPFT.jpg",
      "premiere": "International Premiere",
